claim.claim-text:
obtaining, by a client device, respective recipient data for multiple recipients;
generating, by the client device, an attestation token comprising a set of data and a digital signature of the set of data;
generating, by the client device, an attachment element for each recipient of the multiple recipients, each attachment element comprising the respective recipient data for the recipient and a binding that cryptographically binds the attachment element to the attestation token; and
sending, by the client device, a communication that includes the attestation token and the attachment elements to at least one recipient.
